w("\n## 10. Objectives against outcomes\n")
w("1. Labelled dataset of healthy and diseased leaves: **achieved** (PlantDoc 2,578 images, 28 classes, 13 crops; web photos, not self-collected).")
w("2. Preprocess and augment: **partly** (resize to 224 and in-model flip/rotation/zoom/contrast in `train.py`; the product's heuristic only resizes to 256).")
